          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ibisaka vyo mu kibira azobitemesha icuma, n’i Lebanoni hazotsindwa n’uwo muhizi.",
          "type": "text",
